rent * 2 + extra = wage

the cost of their rent would go toward paying the mortgage, taxes, and into a
fund for repairs and such. Building upkeep == rent. The "rent*2" part would be
placed into... escrow? I think is the right word? It'd be set aside, and when
they wanted to stop working for me, they could stay in the building so long as
that escrow paid their rent. Or they could move out early and I'd give it to
