saved, then they just get a "raise" in the form of the rent*2 payment) then they
have more of a runway for moving on when they want. The "extra" is a pool that
everyone that works for me contributes to when they make money, however they do
it. Oh and the people with remote jobs who make 100k+ per year? They pay 3x rent
